************************************************************************
* Copycode   C-ESCAP2
* Function   ESCAPE LOGIC - abort PF3 when data not ok
*
* Maintenance:
* SU1     2017-02-07 NOMALL-1478 created
************************************************************************
*
PERFORM COMMIT-WORK #DATA-OK #BACKOUT /*S-COMMIT
IF NOT #DATA-OK AND NOT #BACKOUT AND G-AUTOCOMMIT = 'E'
  ESCAPE TOP /*INPUT again
END-IF
RESET G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT
IF *LEVEL > 1 OR *DATA = -1
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
FETCH #FATHER-PROG
**end of copycode C-ESCAP2 *********************************************
